WEBVTT

00:06:59.996 --> 00:07:01.996
and I'm going to press my dongle and the rest of it's going to come up,

00:07:01.996 --> 00:07:04.996
but no -- that's the whole slide.

00:07:04.996 --> 00:07:06.996
(Laughter)

00:07:06.996 --> 00:07:09.996
There is nothing on the other side.

00:07:11.996 --> 00:07:13.996
So, completely irrational,

00:07:13.996 --> 00:07:15.996
you would think.

00:07:15.996 --> 00:07:18.996
Except that, wait a minute, politicians are rational, too,

00:07:18.996 --> 00:07:21.996
and they're responding to what they think the voters want.

00:07:21.996 --> 00:07:23.996
So what we see is that voters respond

00:07:23.996 --> 00:07:25.996
very well to things like this

00:07:25.996 --> 00:07:28.996
and not quite so well to things like this.

00:07:28.996 --> 00:07:35.996
(Laughter)